.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">Ant.</span>\n<span class=\"refch\">470,</span> <span class=\"ital\">etc.</span>\n||</div>\n<div class=\"pp\"><span class=\"ppa\">2</span> un peu :\n<span class=\"grec\">σχ. πρόσθεν,</span> <span class=\"aut\">Soph.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">O.R.</span> <span class=\"refch\">736,</span> peu avant ||</div>\n<div class=\"pp\"><span class=\"ppa\">3</span> peut-être, <span class=\"aut\">Dius</span> (<span class=\"aut\">Stob.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">Fl.</span> <span class=\"refch\">65, 17</span>) ; <span class=\"grec\">σχ. ἴσως,</span> <span class=\"aut\">Plat.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">Soph.</span> <span class=\"refpa\">253</span><span class=\"refpb\">c</span>, <span class=\"ital\">etc. ;</span> <span class=\"grec\">σχ. που,</span> <span class=\"aut\">DS.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">Exc.</span> <span class=\"refch\">537, 51,</span> peut-être ;\n<span class=\"ital\">avec ironie :</span> <span class=\"grec\">σχ.\nτι τὴν σὴν οὐ καταισχύνω φύσιν,</span> <span class=\"aut\">Soph.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">El.</span> <span class=\"refch\">608,</span> je pense que je ne fais pas honte à mon origine\n(au sang que j’ai reçu de toi) ; <span class=\"grec\">σχ. ἔχω ὃ εἰπὼν\nἀναγκάσω σε λέγειν,</span> <span class=\"aut\">Plat.</span>\n<span class=\"oeuv\">Phædr.</span> <span class=\"refpa\">236</span><span class=\"refpb\">d</span>, je pense avoir un\nargument au moyen duquel je te forcerai à parler ; <span class=\"ital\">dans les réponses :</span> peut-être, précisément,\n<span class=\"aut\">Plat.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">Soph.</span>\n<span class=\"refpa\">250</span><span class=\"refpb\">c</span>,\n<span class=\"refpa\">255</span><span class=\"refpb\">c</span>,\n<span class=\"ital\">etc.</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"etymrev\"><span class=\"etiqetymrev\">Étym.</span>\n<span class=\"grec\">ἔχω, -δον</span>.</div>\n"}]}